{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29568","headline":"彭城公薨後赠杜二十七胜李十七潘二君竝与愚同出故尚书安平公门下 · 李商隐","name":"彭城公薨後赠杜二十七胜李十七潘二君竝与愚同出故尚书安平公门下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁山兖水约从公，两地参差一旦空。\n谢墅庾村相吊後，自今歧路各西东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}